OL,3,ARussell Brand was 'ruthless and
OL,4,Acalculated', says prosecution as rape
OL,5,Aand sexual assault trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to reporters, he said he felt
OL,8,F"blessed", adding: "I feel of course
OL,9,Fconcerned but hopeful this process will
OL,10,Flead to good outcomes for everybody -
OL,11,Fthat is my prayer"
OL,13,FThe trial is expected to last up to six
OL,14,Fweeks at Southwark Crown Court in
OL,15,Fcentral London
